# VOX sings by itself when asked: a VOX sound's key held and ALGO turned right, that sound sings (rarely,
# now and then, often): a few soft notes in the key, not the hands', with rests between. It sings with
# that sound whichever is in hand after; left again, it stops. Nothing sings as made, or with the clock
# stopped. The tempo is not turned by that ALGO.
wait 1000
expect vsing 0
wait 20000
expect vox_notes 0
key b8 down
wait 100
turn ALGO 3
wait 100
key b8 up
expect vsing 3
expect vsing_snd 2
expect set_bpm 90
shot sing.png
tapkey b7
wait 100
expect vcur 1
wait 60000
expect vox_notes >3
expect clips 0
tap SEQ
wait 5000
expect vox_sounds 0
expect vox_notes <99
wait 20000
expect vox_notes 0
tap SEQ
wait 30000
expect vox_notes >0
key b8 down
wait 100
turn ALGO -3
wait 100
key b8 up
expect vsing 0
wait 4000
expect vox_notes <99
wait 30000
expect vox_notes 0
expect clips 0
